  m_text: "\"It\u2019s said a day came when King Ivan grew tired and frustrated and ordered the destruction of a town demanding his downfall. The town was raided and burned to ash, many gone, and the survivors without a home. The people were outraged, yet this is when the truth was revealed.\u201D "
