  m_text: "\u201CMisha was conducting Ivan like a puppet, making him an enemy to the public. Regaining his mind, Ivan ordered Misha to be executed for her crimes. Misha fled, escaping her punishment. People still question the story, unsure if the kings\u2019 words were true. One truth remains, Misha may still be wandering the kingdom, waiting near the village she grew up in, preparing her reven- \u201C "
